{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QGeometricLanglands.Mirror3d3dCorrespondence","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QGeometricLanglands.Mirror3d3dCorrespondence","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.mirror3d3dCorrespondence_refutable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.mirror3d3dCorrespondence_refutable","kind":"theorem","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/q-geometric-langlands/mirror-3d-3d-correspondence.lean#L139-L149","doc":"The class is **refutable**, which the previous `holds : Prop` carrier was not: the\nconstant-zero families agree at every order and so satisfy `four_loop_matches`, but fail\n`borromean_h4`.\n\nA theorem rather than a docstring claim, because \"the carrier asserts something\" is\nprecisely the property that was missing. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.mirror3d3d_four_loop_value","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.mirror3d3d_four_loop_value","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/q-geometric-langlands/mirror-3d-3d-correspondence.lean#L131-L137","doc":"**The gauge-theory four-loop coefficient is `−3/4`** — derived from the two fields\nrather than stated as a third. This is the block's actual prediction on the gauge side,\nand it follows rather than being assumed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.Mirror3d3dCorrespondence.borromean_h4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.Mirror3d3dCorrespondence.borromean_h4","kind":"theorem","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/q-geometric-langlands/mirror-3d-3d-correspondence.lean#L129-L129","doc":"The Borromean Markov-trace `h⁴` coefficient is `−3/4` — the same value D10's carrier\nconstrains as `levelCoeff 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.Mirror3d3dCorrespondence.four_loop_matches","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.Mirror3d3dCorrespondence.four_loop_matches","kind":"theorem","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/q-geometric-langlands/mirror-3d-3d-correspondence.lean#L126-L126","doc":"The gauge-theory four-loop contribution equals the framework's `h⁴` coefficient.\nThis is the correspondence's content at the one order the block pins. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.Mirror3d3dCorrespondence.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.Mirror3d3dCorrespondence.mk","kind":"ctor","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/q-geometric-langlands/mirror-3d-3d-correspondence.lean#L122-L122","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.Mirror3d3dCorrespondence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.Mirror3d3dCorrespondence","kind":"class","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/q-geometric-langlands/mirror-3d-3d-correspondence.lean#L110-L129","doc":"**CONJECTURE (3d–3d mirror).** The 3d–3d correspondence applied to the Borromean rings\ncomplement: the four-loop perturbative coefficient of `Z_{T[B₃]}` matches the framework's\nMarkov-trace `h⁴` coefficient.\n\n`pertCoeff` indexes the gauge-theory side by loop order and `markovCoeff` the framework\nside by power of `h`; both are supplied by the **caller**, so the class is false for\nfamilies that do not agree at the stated place and value.\n\n**No instance is provided.** Downstream results consume this as\n`[Mirror3d3dCorrespondence pertCoeff markovCoeff]` and are genuinely conditional on it.\n\n-- Ref: [leitner2026] conj:mirror-3d-3d-correspondence ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:mirror-3d-3d-correspondence","label":"conj:mirror-3d-3d-correspondence","md":"quantum-observable-universe/q-geometric-langlands/mirror-3d-3d-correspondence.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}